# Ephemeral DVB-T2 AWGN campaign run output (per-curve logs, JSON-lines
# traces, and checkpoint dirs produced by dvb_t2_awgn_campaign). The committed
# reference artefacts in this directory are PLAN.md, README.md, plot.py, the
# TOML/CSV references, and smoke/. Actual campaign curves are written to an
# --output-dir (typically under /tmp); any curve_* dir that lands here is a
# local run and must not be tracked.
curve_*/

# Driver run logs (ephemeral; wall-clock recorded in README.md)
*_driver.log
